> this dossier shows starred, but fully expanded i do not see any starred messages
Filed as 735 at the head of Next, as your defect in what went live at 5:33, and a seat starts its correction now: the case first (a title star with no visible starred message), then one run per engine, then its review, and it rides the next cut. One hypothesis to check, not a finding: the star belongs to a message the dossier has not loaded (behind Earlier messages) or to its folded first message, which the piece correcting tonight (a closed dossier shows its starred first message whole) touches too. The start line comes under this message.
